  "hypothesis": "Enter a long position in TLT at the open of the next trading day whenever WTI crude futures (CL=F) close up ≥ 1.5% from the prior day’s close; exit the position when CL=F closes down ≥ 1% from the entry‑day’s close or after three trading days, whichever occurs first.",
