  "explanation": "\n\nAfter accounting for the trader’s 0.10 % per‑trade cost, the strategy lost ‑48.2 % while a simple buy‑and‑hold of TLT fell only ‑10.7 % and the S&P 500 over the same period gained +60.9 %. The approach was in the market just 36 % of days, suffered a maximum drawdown of ‑51.8 % and posted a negative Sharpe of ‑0.59, indicating high risk and poor risk‑adjusted returns. Given these dismal performance figures and the lack of any supportive robustness evidence, the edge appears to be spurious rather than genuine, leading to a **Weak** verdict.",
  "code": "import yfinance as yf\nimport pandas as pd\nimport numpy as np\nimport time\nimport json\n\ndef download_with_retry(ticker, start):\n    for attempt in range(3):\n        df = yf.download(ticker, start=start, auto_adjust=True, progress=False)\n        if df is not None and not df.empty:\n            close = df[\"Close\"].squeeze()\n            return close\n        time.sleep(3)\n    raise RuntimeError(f\"Failed to download {ticker} after 3 attempts\")\n\nstart_date = \"2015-01-01\"\n\n# Download data\ntlt_close = download_with_retry(\"TLT\", start_date)\ncl_close = download_with_retry(\"CL=F\", start_date)\nspy_close = download_with_retry(\"SPY\", start_date)\n\n# Align all series to TLT calendar (traded asset calendar)\ncl_aligned = cl_close.reindex(tlt_close.index, method='ffill')\nspy_aligned = spy_close.reindex(tlt_close.index, method='ffill')\n\n# Daily returns\ntlt_ret = tlt_close.pct_change().fillna(0)\ncl_ret = cl_aligned.pct_change().fillna(0)\nspy_ret = spy_aligned.pct_change().fillna(0)\n\n# Signal: CL=F closes up >= 1.5% from prior day's close\nsignal = (cl_ret >= 0.015)\n\n# Build holding array (1 on entry day and every holding day)\nn = len(tlt_close)\nholding_vals = np.zeros(n, dtype=int)\ndates = tlt_close.index\n\ni = 0\nwhile i < n:\n    # Position today = holding yesterday\n    pos_today = holding_vals[i-1] if i > 0 else 0\n    \n    if pos_today == 0 and signal.iloc[i]:\n        # Enter at close of day i\n        entry_cl = cl_aligned.iloc[i]\n        holding_vals[i] = 1  # Entry day in holding series\n        \n        exited = False\n        # Check exit on next 3 trading days (position days i+1, i+2, i+3)\n        for k in range(1, 4):\n            if i + k >= n:\n                break\n            # Exit if CL=F closes down >= 1% from entry day's close\n            if cl_aligned.iloc[i + k] < entry_cl * 0.99:\n                # Hold through day i+k-1 (holding days i+1 to i+k-1)\n                for h in range(i + 1, i + k):\n                    holding_vals[h] = 1\n                exited = True\n                break\n        \n        if not exited:\n            # Hold max 3 days (holding days i+1, i+2)\n            for h in range(i + 1, min(i + 3, n)):\n                holding_vals[h] = 1\n    i += 1\n\nholding = pd.Series(holding_vals, index=dates)\nposition = holding.shift(1, fill_value=0)\n\n# Trading costs: 0.1% per entry (round trip) subtracted on entry day\nentries = (position == 1) & (position.shift(1, fill_value=0) == 0)\nstrat_ret = position * tlt_ret\nstrat_ret[entries] -= 0.001\n\n# Equity curves\nstrat_equity = (1 + strat_ret).cumprod()\ntlt_equity = (1 + tlt_ret).cumprod()\nspy_equity = (1 + spy_ret).cumprod()\n\n# Metrics\ntotal_return = float(strat_equity.iloc[-1] - 1)\nbuy_and_hold_return = float(tlt_equity.iloc[-1] - 1)\n\n# SPY same days return (compounded SPY return on days strategy held position)\nspy_same_days_return = float((1 + spy_ret[position == 1]).prod() - 1)\n\n# SPY random days return\nn_days_pos = int(position.sum())\nmean_spy_ret = float(spy_ret.mean())\nspy_random_days_return = float((1 + mean_spy_ret) ** n_days_pos - 1)\n\ntime_in_market = float(position.mean())\nsharpe = float(strat_ret.mean() / strat_ret.std() * np.sqrt(252)) if strat_ret.std() > 0 else 0.0\nmax_drawdown = float((strat_equity / strat_equity.cummax() - 1).min())\nn_trades = int(entries.sum())\n\n# Save equity curves\nequity_df = pd.DataFrame({\n    'date': dates,\n    'strategy': strat_equity.values,\n    'spy': spy_equity.values\n})\nequity_df.to_csv('equity.csv', index=False)\n\nresult = {\n    \"traded_ticker\": \"TLT\",\n    \"total_return\": total_return,\n    \"buy_and_hold_return\": buy_and_hold_return,\n    \"spy_same_days_return\": spy_same_days_return,\n    \"spy_random_days_return\": spy_random_days_return,\n    \"time_in_market\": time_in_market,\n    \"sharpe\": sharpe,\n    \"max_drawdown\": max_drawdown,\n    \"n_trades\": n_trades\n}\n\nprint(f'RESULT {json.dumps(result)}')\n",
